1
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,280
{\an8}<i>hikaru kumo wo tsukinuke</i>

2
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,280
<i>Breaking through the flying clouds, I...</i>

3
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,780
{\an8}<i>Fly Away < Fly Away ></i>

4
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
{\an8}<i>karadajuu ni hirogaru panorama</i>

5
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
<i>A panorama spreading throughout my body</i>

6
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
{\an8}<i>kao wo kerareta chikyuu ga</i>

7
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
<i>Kicked in the face, the Earth gets</i>

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
{\an8}<i>okotte < okotte ></i>

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
<i>Angry < Angry ></i>

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
{\an8}<i>kazan wo bakuhatsu saseru</i>

11
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
<i>And makes a volcano explode</i>

12
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
{\an8}<i>toketa koori no naka ni</i>

13
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
<i>If, in the melted polar ice,</i>

14
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
{\an8}<i>kyouryuu ga itara tamanori shikomitai ne</i>

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
<i>There is a dinosaur, I want to train it to ride on a ball</i>

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,860
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

17
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
{\an8}<i>nani ga okite mo kibun wa heno heno kappa</i>

18
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
<i>Whatever happens, it won't bother me one bit</i>

19
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:09,670
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA mune ga</i>

20
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
{\an8}<i>pachi-pachi suru hodo sawagu</i>

21
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
<i>As loud as my heart pounds,</i>

22
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,010
{\an8}<i>Genki Dama</i>

23
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,010
<i>The Genki Dama roars.</i>

24
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:17,760
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

25
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
{\an8}<i>atama karappo no hou ga yume tsumekomeru</i>

26
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
<i>A head that's empty is easier to stuff with dreams</i>

27
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:30,360
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

28
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
{\an8}<i>egao urutora Z de</i>

29
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
<i>With a smile that's Ultra-Z</i>

30
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
{\an8}<i>kyou mo ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

31
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
<i>Even today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

32
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:39,240
{\an8}<i>Sparking!</i>

33
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,780
Why are they having no effect?!

34
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,580
<i>Crasher...</i>

35
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:26,850
<i>Ball!</i>

36
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,100
He deflected it!

37
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:41,310
Damn it!

38
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,640
<i>Goku's strength is surprising.</i>

39
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:48,020
<i>However, he still does not appear to be taking this fight seriously.</i>

40
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:58,570
{\an8}At Last, a Direct Confrontation!!

41
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:58,570
{\an8}Captain Ginyu Takes the Field

42
00:03:07,210 --> 00:03:09,650
Wh-Where did he go?

43
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:12,880
Behind you, Butta!

44
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:14,630
What?!

45
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,640
Yo.

46
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:21,430
H-How did you get behind me?!

47
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:28,140
Behind me, who prides himself on being the fastest in the universe!

48
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:29,860
Maybe you're second-fastest in the universe?

49
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:34,760
<i>H-How can this be?</i>

50
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:38,820
<i>Not only did he repel my Crusher Ball, he managed to slip behind Butta!</i>

51
00:03:40,930 --> 00:03:43,370
<i>It's as if I'm having a bad dream.</i>

52
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:50,210
Bastard... Who are you?!

53
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:53,670
I am a Saiyan, who was raised on Earth... I guess.

54
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:56,940
Don't be ridiculous!

55
00:03:56,940 --> 00:04:00,080
How can a Saiyan have that kind of speed?!

56
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:03,680
How should I know? It must be from my having trained so hard.

57
00:04:04,250 --> 00:04:06,980
Still, you can't win on speed alone!

58
00:04:06,980 --> 00:04:09,230
Not if all you're doing is running away!

59
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:15,940
Once you've worn yourself out running away, you'll lose those sharp reflexes, and then you'll die!

60
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,120
Go ahead, dodge me!

61
00:04:30,890 --> 00:04:32,170
C-Can you see that?

62
00:04:33,090 --> 00:04:34,420
Not at all.

63
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:46,320
Dammit!

64
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:50,760
How can members of the Ginyu Special Corps let that runt make fools of them?!

65
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:04,940
It's all you can do to just evade me! I could defeat you right now!

66
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,100
We'll see about that.

67
00:05:15,380 --> 00:05:17,380
What do you think you're doing?!

68
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:19,130
What about you? Where were you looking?!

69
00:05:19,130 --> 00:05:20,130
What?!

70
00:05:20,130 --> 00:05:21,470
Why you...

71
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:31,170
Hold on. This is no time to be fighting each other.

72
00:05:31,170 --> 00:05:33,310
R-Right.

73
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,840
Shall I show you then?

74
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,900
How there's more to me than just speed?

75
00:05:39,530 --> 00:05:41,610
What?!

76
00:06:16,330 --> 00:06:19,360
I hope you understand now. Give up this senseless fight.

77
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:27,540
This guy, and the one before him, are both still alive.

78
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,870
Hurry up and take the two of them and get off this planet.

79
00:06:29,870 --> 00:06:31,990
D-Don't be a fool!

80
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:34,870
Kakarrot, finish them! Finish them off!

81
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,580
These two are all beat up.

82
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:39,880
There's no need to kill them for no reason!

83
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:49,430
H-How can this be? We're the Ginyu Special Corps, you know!

84
00:06:54,330 --> 00:06:56,800
W-We're a super elite fighting force,

85
00:06:56,800 --> 00:07:00,650
comprised of the five best warriors in all the universe!

86
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:03,950
How can we be beaten by such a low-level fighter?!

87
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,000
This is a nightmare!

88
00:07:08,670 --> 00:07:12,760
I'm going to be done in, and there's nothing I can do!

89
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:17,670
He's running away!

90
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:20,920
There's no helping some people, huh?

91
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:23,160
He just left his friends behind.

92
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:32,730
Sorry, guys, there ain't any <i>senzu</i> left.

93
00:07:32,730 --> 00:07:33,710
Hey...

94
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:38,030
A-Are you really Goku?

95
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,980
Yeah. I've just been through some incredible training is all.

96
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:49,160
Vegeta!

97
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:16,700
How could you?! I told you there was no need to finish them off!

98
00:08:17,350 --> 00:08:19,100
Those guys couldn't even move.

99
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:25,360
It utterly sickens me with how lenient you always are!

100
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:31,080
Why did you let that other one get away?

101
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,120
With your strength now, you could have easily disposed of him!

102
00:08:37,850 --> 00:08:42,750
It appears that you were unable to fully become a Super Saiyan after all.

103
00:08:43,310 --> 00:08:44,840
Super Saiyan?

104
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:48,420
You seem to be proud with how overwhelmingly strong you've become,

105
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:50,920
but even so, there's no way you can beat Freeza.

106
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:53,160
Not unless you make yourself immortal or something.

107
00:08:54,530 --> 00:08:58,350
You have no idea how terrible Freeza is!

108
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:01,980
I hate to sound like I'm blowing my own horn,

109
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:04,640
but I think I've become a lot stronger.

110
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,990
Even so, you say that there's no way I can defeat this Freeza guy?

111
00:09:08,510 --> 00:09:12,490
That's right. If you plan on fighting him, then brace yourself.

112
00:09:12,950 --> 00:09:17,160
Freeza's strength goes far beyond anything you can even imagine.

113
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:22,310
A-Are you sure you're not exaggerating a little bit?

114
00:09:22,310 --> 00:09:25,630
I mean, you saw Goku's strength just now, right?

115
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:28,840
Those guys were powerless against him!

116
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:32,010
Is there anyone who can beat Goku now?

117
00:09:32,830 --> 00:09:35,010
In that case, go ahead and try fighting him.

118
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:40,510
What's even worse is that by now,

119
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:43,520
Freeza has probably become immortally young with the Dragon Balls.

120
00:09:44,180 --> 00:09:47,200
Any way you cut it, there's no way to beat him now.

121
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,980
We can only pray that we don't run into him.

122
00:09:49,490 --> 00:09:50,170
No...

123
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:54,660
I don't think he's made his wish yet.

124
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:57,790
Wh-What? How can you tell?!

125
00:09:58,310 --> 00:10:03,730
If the Dragon Balls here are the same as the Dragon Balls on Earth,

126
00:10:03,730 --> 00:10:06,130
then when Shen Long appears, the sky should get dark, right?

127
00:10:06,930 --> 00:10:09,010
But up to now, the sky has remained bright.

128
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:20,270
I don't think it's happened yet.

129
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:23,270
Sh-Shen Long? What is that?

130
00:10:23,810 --> 00:10:26,650
Wh-When you get the Dragon Balls together, does something come out?

131
00:10:26,650 --> 00:10:31,650
Th-That's it! I've got it! He doesn't know what the password is!

132
00:10:31,650 --> 00:10:35,360
He must think that just gathering all seven Dragon Balls together will grant him his wish.

133
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:39,540
A password? You need that too?

134
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:44,510
There's still a chance for us to get our wish granted!

135
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:45,870
Oh, yeah!

136
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,040
Right, Gohan?

137
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:54,520
Hey, Gohan! We still might be able to bring our dead friends back to life!

138
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,030
Hooray!

139
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:57,290
Isn't that great, Gohan?

140
00:10:57,290 --> 00:10:57,920
Yeah!

141
00:10:57,920 --> 00:11:02,890
Yay! We're saved!

142
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:06,060
Goku, that means we have to get the Dragon Balls back, huh?

143
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:07,430
That's right.

144
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:12,070
<i>Sh-Shen Long...</i>

145
00:11:21,990 --> 00:11:26,000
To think that these things can grant any wish...

146
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:37,110
After Freeza-sama gets the password from the Namekians,

147
00:11:37,110 --> 00:11:38,840
he'll be able to obtain eternal life...

148
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:43,210
Which means the whole universe will belong to Freeza.

149
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:46,810
What a wonderful thought.

150
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,330
What did you say?!

151
00:12:14,980 --> 00:12:19,300
Gurd, Reacoom, and Butta were all killed?!

152
00:12:19,980 --> 00:12:23,480
Yes, by some unbelievable kind of guy.

153
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,600
Don't be ridiculous!

154
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,270
We are the Ginyu Special Corps!

155
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:32,360
With the exception of Freeza-sama, there is no one in the world stronger than the Ginyu Special Corps!

156
00:12:33,260 --> 00:12:37,070
Th-That's what I thought too, but the fact remains...

157
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:50,800
So, having those three battle ability ratings disappear

158
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:53,440
wasn't a Scouter malfunction, huh?

159
00:12:54,950 --> 00:12:56,630
Should we contact Freeza-sama?

160
00:12:57,240 --> 00:13:00,800
You must be joking! How can we tell him such shameful news?!

161
00:13:02,470 --> 00:13:04,760
It's a good thing Freeza-sama is not here.

162
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:15,120
I, Commander Ginyu, will give you an example of how a real battle is to be waged.

163
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,780
I-If you please.

164
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,690
Hide the Dragon Balls!

165
00:13:19,690 --> 00:13:23,130
If anything happens to them, you will suffer the wrath of Freeza-sama!

166
00:13:23,130 --> 00:13:24,530
Yes, sir!

167
00:13:35,770 --> 00:13:39,120
Hey you guys, this isn't a game! Hurry up!

168
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,260
Yes, sir!

169
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:09,200
There, no one will find them now.

170
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:12,120
All right then, we're off.

171
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:15,820
I'm going to show them meticulously just how dreadful I can be.

172
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:29,100
Ginyu Special Corps, move out!

173
00:14:35,530 --> 00:14:38,360
Sure enough, it doesn't have the same impact with only two of us.

174
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:42,770
And I just got done thinking up a new one, too...

175
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:48,740
I don't know who you are, but you're going to pay! You're going to pay!

176
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:57,180
I've had it with Dad.

177
00:14:57,180 --> 00:15:00,500
How can he say that Son-kun should have already landed on Namek?

178
00:15:02,730 --> 00:15:07,140
Once Son-kun gets here, <i>I</i> should be the first one he comes and saves.

179
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:14,900
I've been looking after Son-kun ever since he was little.

180
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,980
It's no use.

181
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:23,410
These are all beyond repair.

182
00:15:23,410 --> 00:15:24,670
I don't care anymore!

183
00:15:39,790 --> 00:15:42,090
I wonder if Son-kun has landed yet.

184
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:48,800
It would be great if we could get the Dragon Balls back from them somehow.

185
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:55,600
Vegeta, you know them pretty well, right? Is there any way to go about it?

186
00:15:56,180 --> 00:15:58,770
Weren't you planning to defeat Freeza?

187
00:15:59,810 --> 00:16:02,050
I'd like to if possible,

188
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:05,780
but first, we have to bring everyone who you killed on Earth back to life.

189
00:16:07,710 --> 00:16:13,120
Come to think of it, Kaio-sama told me not to fight Freeza, no matter what.

190
00:16:13,550 --> 00:16:16,200
Even if you get such a worthless wish granted,

191
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:20,420
it won't do any good if Freeza just comes along and wipes out all of Earth soon after, will it?

192
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:24,210
Instead, let me wish myself immortally young.

193
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,320
You've got to be kidding!

194
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:30,690
Letting you do that is no different from letting Freeza do so, is it?!

195
00:16:36,610 --> 00:16:38,980
There are two battle powers headed this way!

196
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,480
So, he's gracing us with his presence?

197
00:16:47,470 --> 00:16:51,610
You let Jheese get away, and now he's returning with Commander Ginyu.

198
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:59,790
No matter how strong you may be, this one's not going to be easy for you.

199
00:17:00,430 --> 00:17:03,390
Him, huh? This one is going to be trouble all right, Goku.

200
00:17:05,830 --> 00:17:08,300
Wait a minute, where's Freeza?

201
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:12,110
Now that he's got the Dragon Balls from Ginyu, he should be at his spaceship.

202
00:17:12,870 --> 00:17:15,680
Looks like he ain't there anymore.

203
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:36,290
I can feel a strong <i>ki</i> way off in this direction.

204
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,000
That's probably Freeza.

205
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,000
B-But that direction is...

206
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:45,840
Oh no! That's where Grand Elder-san is!

207
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:48,960
Grand Elder?

208
00:17:49,430 --> 00:17:53,350
I get it! Freeza was unable to get his wish granted,

209
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:56,050
so now he's headed off to ask a Namekian directly about it!

210
00:17:56,050 --> 00:17:59,350
What? You mean there's still some surviving Namekians?

211
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:03,680
That's probably the one who created the Dragon Balls here.

212
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:06,610
Yeah, that would be Grand Elder-san.

213
00:18:07,230 --> 00:18:08,780
Th-This is bad!

214
00:18:09,470 --> 00:18:13,040
Once he finds out how to get his wish granted,

215
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:16,060
he's certain to kill Grand Elder-san and the others!

216
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:18,750
And if Grand Elder-san dies...

217
00:18:24,110 --> 00:18:30,510
Once I pass away, the Dragon Balls will also disappear.

218
00:18:31,300 --> 00:18:36,010
He doesn't know that if Grand Elder-san dies, the Dragon Balls will be lost too!

219
00:18:36,610 --> 00:18:38,720
Wh-What?

220
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:48,480
They're here!

221
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:13,260
You certainly made a mockery of us earlier, huh?

222
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:16,900
Now the Commander is here to personally make you suffer the consequences!

223
00:19:19,810 --> 00:19:22,390
How about it, Goku? Do you have a chance of winning this time, too?

224
00:19:23,190 --> 00:19:25,160
I won't know until I try.

225
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:28,900
This guy sure appears to have an impressive level of strength, after all.

226
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:35,400
I see, so this is him, huh?

227
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,910
His battle power reads about 5000.

228
00:19:40,670 --> 00:19:43,900
That's right, only 5000. Strange, isn't it?

229
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:45,830
You idiot!

230
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:51,630
You were made to look like fools because you only relied on the Scouter's rating.

231
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:57,090
No doubt he just raised his battle power dramatically for just a moment.

232
00:19:57,090 --> 00:19:58,510
That's the type he is.

233
00:19:59,770 --> 00:20:05,130
In my estimation, I'd say he has an actual battle power of around 60,000.

234
00:20:05,130 --> 00:20:06,720
60,000?

235
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:10,730
But he's a Saiyan! I've never heard of a Saiyan with a 60,000 rating.

236
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:13,400
It's not unheard of.

237
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:17,740
He was probably born an extremely gifted warrior, some kind of mutant, just like we were.

238
00:20:18,410 --> 00:20:22,310
This is shaping up to be a fight more interesting than any I've experienced before.

239
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:26,220
I didn't think the time would ever come when Ginyu-sama

240
00:20:26,220 --> 00:20:28,620
would have to display his true power.

